nce FGFR2-mediated activation of the osteocalcin FGF-responsive element (OCFRE)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}